{
  "patch": "iumrah-business-hotel-sync-permanent-live-feed-v4",
  "description": "Permanent Hotel Sync live-feed URLs: no TTL, no read limit, no automatic token rotation, no snapshot/cache-miss gate; each read resolves the current D1 hotel catalog and current nightly price. Access ends only on explicit manual revoke.",
